    {
     "text": "还在做。……你不用一直盯着。",
     "audio": "voice/progress-3.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "一半了。……别那样看着我，我会分心的。",
     "audio": "voice/progress-4.mp3"
    }
   ],
   "pokeWork": [
    {
     "text": "干嘛？我在忙呢。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeWork-1.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "别戳了，正写到要紧的地方。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeWork-2.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "……看什么看，马上就好。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeWork-3.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "你、你再打扰我，这段就交给你写了！",
     "audio": "voice/pokeWork-4.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "再打扰我，这段就交给你写。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeWork-5.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "……你是来监工的吗？",
     "audio": "voice/pokeWork-6.mp3"
    }
   ],
   "pokeIdle": [
    {
     "text": "找我有事？……没事……也、也行。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeIdle-1.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "闲着呢。要不要给我派点活？",
     "audio": "voice/pokeIdle-2.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "哼，想我了就直说。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeIdle-3.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "闲着……也不代表你可以随便戳我。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeIdle-4.mp3"
    },
    {
     "text": "有空的话……陪我待一会儿也行。",
     "audio": "voice/pokeIdle-5.mp3"
